{
    "title": "IPTV Player Smart TV Streaming",
    "description": "\ud83d\udcfa IPTV player app supports M3U8 downloader, XSPF, M3U formats, \ud83d\udcf9 live stream, Android TV Chromecast & Google cast. Watch IP television in high quality. Live player compatible with IP TV box.\r\n\r\nIPTV Player M3U8\r\n\ud83d\udea9 Create your own playlists like sport TV, news, BBC, etc.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udfe3 Functionality\r\n\ud83d\udfea Simple TV guide.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Live streams & record telecasts.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Create playlists in TV player using M3U8, XSPF, M3U & Web URLs.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Rename & share your playlists.\r\n\ud83d\udfea Download Web IPTV smarters programs on the fly.\r\n\ud83d\udfea You can add online TV live player channels to the favorites.\r\n\r\nIPTV Player\r\n\ud83d\udfe2 Advantages\r\n\u2705 IP television app supports Chromecast.\r\n\u2705 M3U player IPTV pro.\r\n\u2705 Picture in picture.\r\n\u2705 Support Android TV.\r\n\u2705 Live media player is lightweight.\r\n\u2705 Live stream video M3U player is regularly updated.\r\n\u2705 IPTV Pro playlist M3U8 is available in multiple languages.\r\n\u2705 Use \u2b1b dark or \u2b1c light mode.\r\n\r\nNo affiliation with media content providers.\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0f\u23f8\ufe0f\u23fa\ufe0f With IP TV player you can watch your favorite channels, news, films, cartoons & TV shows. Enjoy IP television with Chromecast, Google cast, live stream, M3U, M3U8 downloader to the max \ud83d\ude0d\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n- This application IPTV Player is only a live player that does not contain any preset channels or any other content.\r\n- If you want to watch any content, you need to add your personal playlist from your IPTV provider that has the rights to use that content.\r\n- We do not provide any links or playlists for watching any content.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udcfa IPTV player app supports M3U8 downloader, XSPF, M3U formats, \ud83d\udcf9 live stream, Android TV Chromecast &amp; Google cast. Watch IP television in high quality. Live player compatible with IP TV box.<br><br>IPTV Player M3U8<br>\ud83d\udea9 Create your own playlists like sport TV, news, BBC, etc.<br><br>\ud83d\udfe3 Functionality<br>\ud83d\udfea Simple TV guide.<br>\ud83d\udfea Live streams &amp; record telecasts.<br>\ud83d\udfea Create playlists in TV player using M3U8, XSPF, M3U &amp; Web URLs.<br>\ud83d\udfea Rename &amp; share your playlists.<br>\ud83d\udfea Download Web IPTV smarters programs on the fly.<br>\ud83d\udfea You can add online TV live player channels to the favorites.<br><br>IPTV Player<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Advantages<br>\u2705 IP television app supports Chromecast.<br>\u2705 M3U player IPTV pro.<br>\u2705 Picture in picture.<br>\u2705 Support Android TV.<br>\u2705 Live media player is lightweight.<br>\u2705 Live stream video M3U player is regularly updated.<br>\u2705 IPTV Pro playlist M3U8 is available in multiple languages.<br>\u2705 Use \u2b1b dark or \u2b1c light mode.<br><br>No affiliation with media content providers.<br><br>\u25b6\ufe0f\u23f8\ufe0f\u23fa\ufe0f With IP TV player you can watch your favorite channels, news, films, cartoons &amp; TV shows. Enjoy IP television with Chromecast, Google cast, live stream, M3U, M3U8 downloader to the max \ud83d\ude0d<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>- This application IPTV Player is only a live player that does not contain any preset channels or any other content.<br>- If you want to watch any content, you need to add your personal playlist from your IPTV provider that has the rights to use that content.<br>- We do not provide any links or playlists for watching any content.",
